      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This seems like a very exploitable idea\n1. It will create a backlog of reports\n2. People will start going to worlds with the intention of shutting it down: they'll be looking for something they can report or they would just flat out report it and say something generic \"it has trap in name\"\n3. People would make fake accounts and upload low quality worlds and then report them causing a rise in fake and unusable names\n4. People who work hard or create a new world be targeted by people who want the world gone before they even enter",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
