      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As of the current system, i would be against this as it would cause people to just make dummy accounts and report them or target a world owner they dont like and report it for the wrong reasons. There was  abuse in beta when the report weight got leaked out and caused people to just dump reports on a world they dont like because it contains something in the tags like \"furry\" or \"meme\" and could see other worlds current report weight and reports.",
